<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan sells bonds worth 350 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Pakistan sells bonds worth 350 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it auctioned short-term federal bonds worth 350 million rupees in a special open market operation on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
